---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms and conditions for using Pyko.">
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last updated: November 16, 2025</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">By accessing and using Pyko, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Pyko provides CRM automation and alerting services that connect your CRM systems with communication platforms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">3. User Accounts</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account and for all activities that occur under your account.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">4. Payment and Billing</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Subscription fees are billed in advance on a monthly or annual basis. All fees are non-refundable except as required by law.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">The service and its original content remain the property of Pyko and are protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Pyko shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your use of the service.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">7. Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">We may terminate or suspend your account at any time for violations of these Terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mt-8 mb-4">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">For questions about these Terms, contact us at legal@pyko.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
